      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb 4 Bedroom Two Storey Detached House with internal garage on circa 0.75 acres"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall: 14'10\" x 7'9\" c/w Tiled floor\n\nKitchen/Dining: 24'7\" x 11'5\" c/w Solid Pippy Oak units, granite work tops and island, tiled floor, patio doors to side garden\n\nUtility: 11'10\" x 9'4\" c/w Oak coloured units, tiled floor, door to back yard, access to garage\n\nToilet: 5'3\" x 4'1\" c/w Tiled floor\n\nLiving/Dining: 15'3\" x 12'9\" c/w Feature fireplace, solid maple flooring, bay window\n\nSitting Room: 18'6\" x 12'8\" c/w Solid maple flooring, solid stone fireplace, bay window\n\nMaster Bedroom: 13'0\" x 11'0\" c/w Solid pine flooring\n\nBedroom 2: 14'11\" x 12'8\" c/w Solid pine flooring\n\nBedroom 3: 13'0\" x 12'8\" c/w Solid pine flooring\n\nBedroom 4: 13'3\" x 9'9\" c/w Solid pine flooring\n\nMain Bathroom/Ensuite (Jack & Jill design) 12'4\" x 7'5\" c/w Jacuzzi bath, shower unit with Triton T90 electric shower, downlights, tiled floor, part tiled walls\n\nLanding: 18'11\" x 7'9\" c/w Solid pine flooring, hotpress off the landing \n\nGarage: 24'0\" x 12'0\" c/w Access from utility"
      },
